---
import { scratchGames } from '../lib/scratch-card';
---
<section class="scratch-game" aria-label="幸运刮刮乐">
  <div class="game-heading"><span>SCRATCH STUDIO / 四种经典玩法</span><span>✦</span></div>
  <div class="game-picker" role="group" aria-label="选择票种">
    {scratchGames.map((game, index) => <button type="button" data-game={game.id} aria-pressed={index === 0} disabled><strong>{game.name}</strong><span>票面 ¥{game.face} · 模拟体验</span></button>)}
  </div>
  <div class="ticket">
    <header class="ticket-heading"><p>经典玩法 · 指尖体验</p><h2 class="ticket-name">中国龙</h2><div class="ticket-meta">票面面值 ¥5 / 官方最高奖 ¥100,000</div></header>
    <div class="ticket-rule"></div>
    <div class="ticket-zones"></div>
    <div class="ticket-bottom"><span class="ticket-number">NO. 000001</span><span>演示票 · 不可兑奖</span><span>✦ ✦ ✦</span></div>
  </div>
  <aside class="game-panel" aria-label="操作与玩法">
  <div class="panel-eyebrow">YOUR LUCKY MOMENT</div>
  <h2 class="panel-title">慢慢刮，<br />惊喜就在下一格。</h2>
  <div class="progress-row"><span class="scratch-hint">每区刮开 55% 自动揭晓</span><span class="progress-text">0%</span></div>
  <div class="progress-track" aria-hidden="true"><div></div></div>
  <p class="game-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在准备演示票…</p>
  <div class="game-actions"><button type="button" class="button button-outline" data-reveal disabled>直接揭晓</button><button type="button" class="button button-primary" data-next disabled>再来一张 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
  <details class="game-help"><summary>玩法、奖级与模拟说明</summary><p class="help-rule"></p><p class="help-tiers"></p><p>本体验参考官方判奖规则，布局与号码区数量经过网页适配，并非实体票复刻。演示奖池在「未中奖」和所列奖级之间等概率选取，再生成满足该总额的票面；这不是官方中奖率、奖级分布或返奖率，不代表真实购彩结果。</p><p>每张票生成时内容即已固定，刮开顺序、速度不影响结果。多个中奖区奖金累加，全部揭晓后结算。可用 Tab 聚焦刮区，再按 Enter 或空格揭晓该区。</p><a class="rules-source" href={scratchGames[0].source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看中国福彩网官方规则 ↗</a></details>
  <p class="demo-notice">非官方模拟 · 无购买、充值或兑换功能</p>
  <noscript><p class="demo-notice">请启用 JavaScript 后体验刮刮乐。</p></noscript>
  </aside>
</section>
<script>
  import '../scripts/scratch-card';
</script>
<style is:global>
  .scratch-game { width: min(1380px, 100%); margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px clamp(18px, 3vw, 48px) 48px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(150px, 190px) minmax(320px, 470px) minmax(220px, 280px); gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 64px); justify-content: center; align-items: start; }
  .scratch-game .game-heading { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .scratch-game .game-picker { grid-column: 1; }
  .scratch-game .ticket { grid-column: 2; }
  .scratch-game .game-panel { grid-column: 3; padding-top: 20px; min-width: 0; }
  .scratch-game .panel-eyebrow { font: 9px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent); }
  .scratch-game .panel-title { font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 30px); line-height: 1.6; letter-spacing: -1px; color: var(--heading); margin-top: 16px; font-weight: 500; }
  .scratch-game .game-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: var(--muted); font: 10px var(--mono); letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .scratch-game .game-picker { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; padding-top: 20px; }
  .scratch-game .game-picker button { padding: 18px 16px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 10px; background: var(--surface); transition: background .2s, border-color .2s; }
  .scratch-game .game-picker button[aria-pressed='true'] { background: var(--accent-soft); border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-strong); }
  .scratch-game .game-picker strong { display: block; font-size: 13px; }
  .scratch-game .game-picker button span { display: block; font-size: 8px; margin-top: 4px; }
  .scratch-game .demo-notice { text-align: center; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); margin: 15px 0; }
  .scratch-game .ticket { --ticket-color: #a83732; padding: 26px 22px 18px; background: var(--ticket-color); color: #fff0cf; border: 1px solid #ffffff30; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 14px 32px -20px #30130c80; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .scratch-game .ticket::before { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 190px; height: 190px; border: 1px solid #ffd68a24; border-radius: 50%; top: -110px; right: -70px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 20px #ffd68a0a, 0 0 0 40px #ffd68a08; pointer-events: none; }
  .scratch-game .ticket-heading p { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .scratch-game .ticket-heading h2 { color: #fff0cf; font: 700 40px/1.5 var(--serif); margin: 4px 0; letter-spacing: 3px; }
  .scratch-game .ticket-meta { font-size: 10px; color: #fff0cf; }
  .scratch-game .ticket-rule { margin: 18px 0; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.9; }
  .scratch-game .zone-group + .zone-group { margin-top: 16px; }
  .scratch-game .zone-group h3 { color: #fff0cf; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .scratch-game .zone-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px; }
  .scratch-game .zone-group.reference-group .zone-grid, .scratch-game .zone-group.wide-group .zone-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .scratch-game .scratch-area { position: relative; min-width: 0; height: 86px; border: 2px solid #f0d6a4; border-radius: 5px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff6df; }
  .scratch-game .reference-group .scratch-area { height: 68px; }
  .scratch-game .zone-value { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 4px; color: #713729; padding: 4px; }
  .scratch-game .zone-value strong { font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .scratch-game .zone-value small { font-size: 10px; }
  .scratch-game .zone-value .duel-value { font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .scratch-game .zone-value .triple-value { font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 3px; }
  .scratch-game .scratch-area.is-win { background: #ffe7a8; border-color: #ffcd59; }
  .scratch-game .zone-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; padding: 0; cursor: crosshair; touch-action: none; }
  .scratch-game .zone-overlay:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #713729; outline-offset: -4px; z-index: 1; }
  .scratch-game .zone-overlay:disabled { pointer-events: none; }
  .scratch-game canvas { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
  .scratch-game .ticket-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; margin-top: 18px; font-size: 8px; }
  .scratch-game .ticket-number { font-family: var(--mono); }
  .scratch-game .progress-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 10px; margin-top: 22px; }
  .scratch-game .progress-text { font-family: var(--mono); }
  .scratch-game .progress-track { height: 3px; background: var(--line); border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 9px; overflow: hidden; }
  .scratch-game .progress-track > div { width: 0; height: 100%; background: var(--accent); transition: width .15s; }
  .scratch-game .game-status { margin-top: 22px; min-height: 48px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--heading); line-height: 1.9; }
  .scratch-game .game-actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column-reverse; gap: 10px; margin-top: 20px; }
  .scratch-game .game-actions button { min-width: 125px; }
  .scratch-game button:disabled { opacity: .5; }
  .scratch-game .zone-overlay:disabled { opacity: 1; }
  .scratch-game .game-help { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 16px; }
  .scratch-game .game-help summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--text); }
  .scratch-game .game-help p { margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.9; }
  .scratch-game .rules-source { display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px; color: var(--accent-strong); text-decoration: underline; }
  @media (min-width: 1001px) {
    .scratch-game .game-picker, .scratch-game .game-panel { position: sticky; top: 28px; }
    .scratch-game .scratch-area { height: 72px; }
    .scratch-game .ticket-heading h2 { font-size: 36px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .scratch-game { grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, 460px) minmax(210px, 280px); gap: 24px; }
    .scratch-game .game-heading { display: none; }
    .scratch-game .game-picker { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); padding-top: 0; gap: 8px; }
    .scratch-game .game-picker button { padding: 12px; }
    .scratch-game .ticket { grid-column: 1; }
    .scratch-game .game-panel { grid-column: 2; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .scratch-game { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 12px 16px 32px; gap: 20px; }
    .scratch-game .game-picker { width: 100%; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 5px; }
    .scratch-game .game-picker button { padding: 12px 2px; text-align: center; }
    .scratch-game .game-picker strong { font-size: 12px; }
    .scratch-game .game-picker button span { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
    .scratch-game .ticket { width: 100%; max-width: 470px; align-self: center; padding: 22px 14px 16px; }
    .scratch-game .ticket-heading h2 { font-size: 34px; }
    .scratch-game .ticket-rule { font-size: 10px; }
    .scratch-game .zone-grid { gap: 6px; }
    .scratch-game .zone-value .triple-value { font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .scratch-game .game-panel { width: 100%; max-width: 470px; align-self: center; padding-top: 0; }
    .scratch-game .panel-title, .scratch-game .panel-eyebrow { display: none; }
    .scratch-game .progress-row { margin-top: 0; }
    .scratch-game .game-actions { flex-direction: row; }
    .scratch-game .game-actions button { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .scratch-game .game-status { min-height: 24px; text-align: center; }
  }
</style>
